          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Decision Intelligence: How AI Is Changing the Way We Make Decisions",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Join us for an evening of talks and networking with people building and applying AI in the real world!",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "We'll explore how AI helps us make better decisions - from business strategy and applied ML to deepfake detection, biometric security, and AI safety.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "text": "🎤 Our Speakers", "type": "text" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
