              "text": "Arkady Sandler",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": { "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/asandler/" }
                },
                { "type": "bold" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " — AI/ML veteran, 5x founder and entrepreneur. Working on AI-powered decision-making and innovation.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Efim Boieru",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": { "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/efimboieru/" }
                },
                { "type": "bold" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " — Senior ML Engineering Manager at Incode, leading the development of deepfake detection, face liveness, and biometric security systems.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Alena Air",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
