                },
                { "type": "bold" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " — AI Safety Research Scientist & Engineer, researching autonomous AI systems and their risks.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Daria Nikanorova",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
