            {
              "text": " — Machine Learning Team Lead, building ML models that deliver real business results.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [{ "text": "Who's it for?", "type": "text" }]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "AI/ML engineers, founders, product managers, entrepreneurs, and anyone interested in practical AI.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The meetup and all talks will be held in English.",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Come to learn something new, meet interesting people, and have some good conversations about AI.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
